"test7" COMMENTS
================

******************* Step to run this test *******************************

1. make -f makefile.man all

2. test7.sh 

    the result will be on "test7.SRr0".  The log will be on "test7.SLr0"
    The test will require the user to prepare the 8 tapes that
    have been written by "test8".  The user will need to put the tapes 
    TEST01-TEST04 on the drive related to "/cfs/ctape0" and load the first
    tape; also use tapes TEST11-TEST14 on the drive related to "/cfs/ctape1
    and load the first tape onto the drive.  Then the user
    will need to hit the return.  


   THE TEST TAKES ~30 MINUTES TO RUN; 

